  "body": "_Filing this against Infra, since it applies to all specs..._\r\n\r\nWHATWG specs have `<link href=\"https://resources.whatwg.org/logo-XXX.svg\" rel=\"icon\">`\r\n\r\n[Browser support for SVG favicons is poor](https://caniuse.com/#feat=link-icon-svg) and [doesn't seem likely to improve soon](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=294179). Can these be switched to use the `.png` versions?\r\n\r\n&lt;&lt;Insert argument about this being an incentive for browsers to prioritize supporting SVG favicons here.&gt;&gt;\r\n\r\n(As an aside: kudos on the XHR logo. That makes me smile every time I see it.) \r\n\r\ncc: @foolip ",
